				<i>guarding</i>, <i>preserving</i>,
				<i>defense</i>, <i>protection</i>,
				<i>preservation;</i> with <i>gen.
				subj.</i> praetoris, <i><span class="en">Dig. 7, 4, 1</span></i> pr.; with <i>gen. obj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tuitio sui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Top. 23, 90</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pudoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 2 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 37, 11, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 9, 9</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">militaris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 1, 46, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aedium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. in Isa. 16, 57, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
